<title>CHINA: SHANGHAI WORLDBEST 97 H1 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>SHANGHAI WORLDBEST 97 H1 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		    246.750	vs  202.126</p>
<p> Net profit		   48.460	vs   30.660</p>
<p> Net assets per share	3.017 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	  0.203 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Worldbest Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results were contained in a company statement made available on Monday.</p>
<p>Net assets per share and earnings per share for the first half of 1996 were unavailable.</p>
<p>The figures are unaudited as Chinese securities rules do not require listed firms to have their interim results audited.</p>
<p>-- Shanghai Newsroom (8621) 6279-7004 Fax: 6279-7174</p>
